    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Moore Larkin have the pleasure of presenting to the market this wonderful, detached bungalow home situated in Bealnamulla, Athlone. This property will appeal to buyers looking for a stand-alone detached family home conveniently situated near a range of local amenities including Cloonakilla N.S, SuperValu, Pharmacy, the Athlone Springs Hotel, the Mill Bar and recreational facilities, ensuring that every convenience is within easy reach. A most convenient bus stop provides easy access to Athlone town centre.\n\nBuilt in the 1970`s to a solid standard, this home has the benefit of a sunny south facing front, with the living area on this side of the house. The accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, sitting room, kitchen, dining room / living room, four generous bedrooms and a family bathroom. And the entire property stands on a site measuring 0.29 acres with a large rear garden / patio area.\n\nTHIS IS A FABULOUS PROPERTY AND EARLY VIEWING IS ADVISED.\n"
      },
